  RM_GreySeaFauna.xml                    TerminalBiomes — authored 2026-09-24
  ==========================================================================
  TERMINALBIOMES_RM_MOD_BUILD_1 wiring pass: the four floor-resident species
  the Grey Sea sheet's `terminal_seas_cast_proposal_2026-09-25.md` names for
  this sea (fessk, sorruth, essarn, otheska) — all APPROVED, owner sitting
  2026-09-25, verdict 1. Role text and body sizes taken from that proposal's
  Grey Sea table; description prose is this pass's own, written from the
  role text, never invented numbers.

  Mechanically plain per the calling item: no C#, no comps beyond the vanilla
  animal shape. Body/pattern copied from RSW_SandStalker.xml's placeholder
  idiom (Graphic_Single, single reused-then-owned texture, three lifeStages)
  — pattern only, none of that creature's own stats reused. Placeholder art:
  flat dark silhouette PNGs at each texPath below, real art already filed to
  the artpipe queue (42 jobs, this proposal's own naming table).

  essarn and sorruth are ALSO wired as catchable fish — see
  RM_GreySeaCatch.xml — per verdict 2 (the newer sea-floor-and-catch law
  wins over the old no-fish ruling for the Grey).
-->
<Defs>

  <!-- =================================================================
       RM_Fessk — the ossuary shrimp. Never attacks, never tamed, never
       caught. Shy scavenger working the fresh dead before the minerals
       take them (grey_deep ban 3: no predation on the Grey's dead).
       ================================================================= -->

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Fessk</defName>
    <label>fessk</label>
    <description>A man-sized, bone-white picker that works the freshly dead before the Grey Sea's minerals can jacket them, all long forelimbs and no bulk, watching from half behind a salt pillar. It has never been seen to attack anything, and it has never been tamed — the moment it is noticed, it is already leaving.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>4.0</MoveSpeed>
      <MarketValue>60</MarketValue>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-10</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>55</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <Wildness>0.9</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>nip</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>3</power>
        <cooldownTime>2.2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Teeth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <race>
      <body>Snake</body>
      <baseBodySize>0.9</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>0.9</baseHealthScale>
      <baseHungerRate>0.3</baseHungerRate>
      <foodType>CarnivoreAnimal</foodType>
      <predator>false</predator>
      <trainability>None</trainability>
      <manhunterOnDamageChance>0.05</manhunterOnDamageChance>
      <manhunterOnTameFailChance>0.05</manhunterOnTameFailChance>
      <lifeExpectancy>10</lifeExpectancy>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalBaby</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalJuvenile</def>
          <minAge>0.15</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalAdult</def>
          <minAge>0.3</minAge>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
    </race>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>AnimalUncommon</li>
    </tradeTags>
  </ThingDef>

